# Workflow

- Conventional Commits: `feat(ingest): …`, `docs(adr): …`, `chore(ci): …`.
- Run the quality gate before every commit, and continue only when it is green:
  `cargo fmt --all --check`
  `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features --locked -- -D warnings`
  `cargo nextest run --locked`
  `cargo deny check`
  `cargo audit`
- Record every non-trivial design decision as `docs/adr/NNNN-title.md`.
- No destructive git commands. Do not push. Deniz pushes.
- `_intern/` is read-only and gitignored. Do not edit it, and do not commit anything from it.
- When the specification is genuinely ambiguous, ask. Do not invent a second product decision.
